"The core begins as a grade-F seed that falls into Kastilla's sea from orbit."
"It first grows mycelium traps that bait microbes with slivers of mana for decades."
"Its first host is a silver bottom-feeding fish, and its next a school-bus-sized shark."
"It networks millions of thrall brains to think for it."
"It spreads across a continent by bursting infected fish into spores that seabirds carry."
"Inside its last host it would take over and infect everyone nearby within about fifty days."
"A blade forged against it slows the takeover."
"It loses a contest of wills and dissolves, saying: You were a worthy adversary. Well played."
"Its essence becomes the bloodline trait Blightborn in the one who beats it."
